{"unit_id":"a1137261060__dsh-session-organizer#card-zh","repo":"a1137261060/dsh-session-organizer","commit":"39e25d5b98314b709b4947340c815349422db5a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-organizer 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话整理插件。它接入 sidebar.workspaces 槽位并替换侧边栏工作区浏览器，将工作区分组和会话文件夹放在同一视图中。用户可以拖动并排序工作区、分组、文件夹和会话，创建嵌套文件夹，查看会话状态与待处理概览，并搜索会话标题及消息。配置同时保存在浏览器 localStorage 和主机的 .dsh 目录，方便跨浏览器保留。适合需要按项目和主题整理大量工作区与会话的 DSH Web 用户；使用 DSH 自带服务，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:304-334","lib/client.js:1923-1946","lib/index.js:142-160"]}
{"unit_id":"a1137261060__dsh-session-organizer#card-en","repo":"a1137261060/dsh-session-organizer","commit":"39e25d5b98314b709b4947340c815349422db5a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-organizer organizes DSH web sessions in the sidebar with workspace groups and per-workspace folders. Users can reorder items, create nested folders, review session status and pending work, and search titles and messages. Settings persist in localStorage and the host's .dsh directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:304-334","lib/client.js:1923-1946","lib/index.js:142-160"]}
