{"unit_id":"a1137261060__dsh-session-organizer#feature-1","repo":"a1137261060/dsh-session-organizer","commit":"39e25d5b98314b709b4947340c815349422db5a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-organizer 的功能「工作区分组」：在侧边栏新建、重命名和删除分组，并将工作区拖入分组或调整顺序。删除分组只解除归属，工作区仍保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:765-792","lib/client.js:1370-1485"]}
