{"unit_id":"a1137261060__dsh-session-organizer#feature-3","repo":"a1137261060/dsh-session-organizer","commit":"39e25d5b98314b709b4947340c815349422db5a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-organizer 的功能「会话状态与待处理概览」：侧边栏按工作区和文件夹汇总等待交互、手动未处理及完成未读的会话，点选条目可打开会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1107-1140","lib/client.js:1726-1805"]}
